# xxri-grub, xxri-firmware-{gpu,intel,amd,nvidia,wireless} and xxri-sound (the
# sound modules with SOF, replacing alsa-modules-6.12.11-tinycore64).
# Not the x86 set renamed: the x86_64 packages are newer builds that link
# different libraries, so this is the .dep closure of the x86_64 repository.
# Check changes with an ELF NEEDED scan of every extension + core.gz, the .dep
# graph alone misses things.
# Two dep files are XXRI's own:
#   alsa.tcz.dep     alsa-modules-KERNEL.tcz -> xxri-sound.tcz
#   elogind.tcz.dep  just libcap. x86_64 dbus links libelogind.so.0, but Tiny
#                    Core's dep also pulls util-linux (shadows busybox's
#                    mount/blkid/fdisk, which XXRI's scripts use), linux-pam and
#                    acl for the logind daemon, which nothing here starts.
